<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh's IDLC '96 profit up 15.11 percent.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh's IDLC '96 profit up 15.11 percent.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The year ended on December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>	  (In million taka unless stated)</p>
<p>				 1996		   1995</p>
<p>    Net profit	     79.91	vs	 69.42</p>
<p>    Gross profit	   104.9	vs	 94.4</p>
<p>    Operational revenue  611.8	vs	428.8</p>
<p>    Dividend    35 taka on 100-taka share vs 35 percent</p>
<p>(Note: Industrial Development Leasing Company of Bangladesh Limited (IDLC) held its annual general meeting on Sunday. It said the higher profit was a result of better quality service and sectoral diversity to ensure a balanced portfolio. The company also offered one-for-one bonus share.)</p>
</text>
